      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T02:01:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I choose this since with `with_context`, we don\u0027t have to care about how to print the propagated error `e`, whereas with `or_binder_exception_with`, it\u0027s our role. ex:\n\n`or_binder_exception_with(ExceptionCode::ILLEGAL_ARGUMENT, |e| {\n    format!(\"Invalid size {}: {:?}\", size_bytes, e)\n})?;`\n\nPlus, it takes one more line than the `with_context` approach.",
